{"id":"d4534f52872ace1d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-unbounded-search.md","title":"严格无界搜索保持部分可计算性","display":"thm-unbounded-search — 严格无界搜索保持部分可计算性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-unbounded-search","aliases":["20-thm-unbounded-search"],"display":"thm-unbounded-search — 严格无界搜索保持部分可计算性","chapter":"1","section":"1.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 1.5.7","source_printed_pages":[13],"source_pdf_pages":[49],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strict-minimization]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-unbounded-search"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-unbounded-search</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-unbounded-search — 严格无界搜索保持部分可计算性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 1.5.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>13</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>49</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"13c94185789a6bef\" href=\"?note=13c94185789a6bef\" title=\"20-df-strict-minimization\">20-df-strict-minimization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathcal C_2\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathcal C_2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Min}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Min}_1\\)</span> 见直接上游。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"13c94185789a6bef\" href=\"?note=13c94185789a6bef\" title=\"20-df-strict-minimization\">20-df-strict-minimization</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}search}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Min}_1(\\theta)\\in\\mathcal C_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}search}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Min}_1(\\theta)\\in\\mathcal C_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在输入 x 上并行模拟 θ(x,0),θ(x,1),…；仅在找到候选 y 的值 1，且全部 z&lt;y 已停止并输出非 1 后，才输出 y。定义条件成立时这些有限计算终会完成；否则没有候选能通过。不能仅返回并行模拟中最早被发现的 1，因为它可能不是最小候选。同一算法对 θ 的程序索引有效，s-m-n 给统一编译。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 1.5.7；印刷页 13；PDF 第 49 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strict-minimization","status":"resolved","id":"13c94185789a6bef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strict-minimization]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e",